<div class="info-card">

<h2>Who is the Current Commissioner of Noida?</h2>

<p>
Smt. Selva Kumari J., IAS, is the current Divisional Commissioner of Meerut Division,
which includes Noida (Gautam Budh Nagar district). As the senior administrative officer
of the division, she oversees district administration, revenue management, public grievance
systems, implementation of government schemes, and coordination between district authorities
and the Government of Uttar Pradesh.
