<!-- ABOUT -->

<div class="info-card">

<h2>About Selva Kumari J., IAS</h2>

<p>
Smt. Selva Kumari J. is a senior IAS officer serving as the Divisional Commissioner
of Meerut Division. The division includes Gautam Budh Nagar (Noida), Ghaziabad,
Meerut, Hapur, Bulandshahr and Baghpat districts.
</p>

<p>
The Commissioner supervises district magistrates, monitors public welfare initiatives,
reviews administrative performance and ensures proper implementation of state government
policies across the division.
</p>

</div>

