<h2>Roles and Responsibilities of the Commissioner</h2>

<ul>

<li>Supervises district administrations within the division.</li>

<li>Monitors implementation of government schemes.</li>

<li>Reviews revenue administration and land management.</li>

<li>Coordinates development and infrastructure projects.</li>

<li>Supports disaster management and emergency response.</li>

<li>Monitors public grievance redressal systems.</li>

<li>Reviews district-level administrative performance.</li>

<li>Acts as a link between district administration and state government.</li>

<li>Coordinates inter-departmental governance activities.</li>

<li>Ensures compliance with government policies.</li>

<li>Oversees administrative supervision of Gautam Budh Nagar district.</li>

